WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.679
Kia ora, thank you for joining us for
Māori Language Week 2020

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.320
our final phrase is

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:11.420
me mahi tahi mo te
marutau o Muruhiku.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.420
Working together for a safer
Southland.

